WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
We need two wholes of the same size. These strips start and end at the same places.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Split the top whole into two equal pieces. One piece is one half. Colour it green.

3
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Split the bottom whole into four equal pieces. One piece is one quarter. Colour it green.

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Compare the green lengths. The half reaches farther. One half is bigger than one quarter of the same whole.

5
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:56.000
More equal pieces in the same whole makes each piece smaller. A bigger bottom number does not mean a bigger piece.
